name=Auto Door Remote
id=AutoDoorRemote
description=Turn vanilla garage doors and fence gates into remote-controlled auto doors. Craft a remote control (Electronics 1), right-click a door to install and pair it — one remote can pair many doors, and you can remove the opener at any time. Keep the remote in your inventory and press K (rebindable) to open or close your doors from the driver's seat. Locked doors still need their original key.

description=把原版车库门和围墙栅栏门变成遥控自动门。用电子材料制作遥控器（电学 1 级），右键门\"安装自动开门器\"完成配对——一把遥控器可配对多扇门，随时可移除开门器。把遥控器放在背包里，按 K（可改键）即可在车内远程开关门。已上锁的门仍需要原配钥匙才会自动解锁。
